Rips_CreateStake
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert.
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── when ticket cap is not a power of two
    │   └── it should revert.
    └── when ticket cap is a power of two
        ├── when prize distribution is empty
        │   └── it should revert.
        └── when prize distribution is not empty
            ├── when a tier has min prize greater than max prize
            │   └── it should revert.
            └── when all tiers have valid prize ranges
                ├── when total winners does not equal ticket cap
                │   └── it should revert.
                └── when total winners equals ticket cap
                    ├── when total prize pool does not equal ticket cap times ticket cost
                    │   └── it should revert.
                    └── when total prize pool equals ticket cap times ticket cost
                        ├── it should store the stake configuration.
                        ├── it should create an initial round.
                        ├── it should increment the next stake ID.
                        └── it should emit a {StakeCreated} event.
